      {
        "text": "Graciela Guzman has been the State Senator for the 20th District since 2025. She previously worked as an organizer for the Chicago Teachers Union and the Healthy Illinois campaign. She also served as chief of staff to Senator Cristina Pacione-Zayas. Her campaign says she helped form the Belmont Cragin Mutual Aid hub during the pandemic.",
        "cites": [1, 2],
        "sentences": [
